1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:04,140
Almen

2
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:07,110
Almen Cathedral

3
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:11,580
That Prismer looks really tough!

4
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:16,760
They were able to defeat it, 
but they couldn't move it,

5
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:20,290
so they ended up building this 
cathedral to keep watch over it.

6
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:24,890
You think if we melted the ice 
like we did with Lyn, it'd start moving?

7
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,620
Quiet, Chris!

8
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:29,260
If you say weird stuff here, 
they'll arrest you!

9
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,960
But... But...

10
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:36,470
It's frozen, but I can still feel some kind 
of power pulsing within it!

11
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:38,450
It might not be dead!

12
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:40,290
I just said...

13
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,420
You there!

14
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:45,450
It's nothing!

15
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:48,140
She's just a little weird...

16
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:51,350
They say magicite beasts 
have appeared in town.

17
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:53,350
It's dangerous, so stay here!

18
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,860
Magicite beasts?

19
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:56,930
I can't wait!

20
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,950
Rani, catch up when you can!

21
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:01,910
Aww, Chris, c'mon!

22
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:04,430
She's usually not this worked up...

23
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:06,870
Hurry! Over here!

24
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:06,880
This way!

25
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:10,840
<i>You can tell they built this town 
to keep watch over the Prismer.</i>

26
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,790
<i>It certainly has no shortage of knights!</i>

27
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:23,580
Wow!

28
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:48,040
<u>Reborn</u>

29
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:48,040
to Master the Blade
     From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire

30
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:48,040
to Master the Blade
From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire

31
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:06,030
Episode 5    Royal Knights' Academy

32
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:02,600
You fool!

33
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:07,070
It's suicide to try and fight a magicite 
beast with no Rune or Artifact!

34
00:03:07,070 --> 00:03:10,320
<i>I can tell from how she moves that she's 
spent no small amount of time training.</i>

35
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,320
Don't throw your life away!

36
00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:12,570
<i>A Greater Rune?</i>

37
00:03:12,570 --> 00:03:14,280
<i>The same as Rani?</i>

38
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:17,620
Th-Thanks! I'll be okay, though!

39
00:03:17,070 --> 00:03:18,070
They're coming!

40
00:03:18,070 --> 00:03:19,000
Fall back!

41
00:03:20,250 --> 00:03:22,710
I'll cut them all down at once!

42
00:03:23,010 --> 00:03:25,420
<i>Oh? Very good!</i>

43
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:29,630
Are you hurt? You need to find shelter!

44
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:31,430
Behind you!

45
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:33,440
It's no good!

46
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,480
Now, take this!

47
00:03:39,490 --> 00:03:40,780
Stupid little thing...

48
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:42,230
I'll help you!

49
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:44,250
She's fast!

50
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:48,330
Now! Hit it!

51
00:03:48,330 --> 00:03:50,110
O-Okay!

52
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:54,450
I'll keep going!

53
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:03,210
Nice!

54
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:04,850
You too...

55
00:04:04,850 --> 00:04:07,220
I guess you didn't need my help before.

56
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:08,740
Sorry.

57
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:10,420
What's your name?

58
00:04:10,950 --> 00:04:13,390
Inglis Eucus.

59
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:16,850
I'm Leone. Leone Olfa.

60
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:19,830
<i>Olfa? I've heard that name before...</i>

61
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,980
Let's work together.

62
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:23,890
Right, Leone.

63
00:04:24,580 --> 00:04:26,080
Let's get to it!

64
00:04:26,980 --> 00:04:31,180
One, two, three!

65
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,970
Nice, a clean hit!

66
00:04:38,970 --> 00:04:39,960
Rani!

67
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:44,010
Chris! You ran off and left me!

68
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,460
I guess that was the last of them.

69
00:04:48,890 --> 00:04:50,430
This is Leone.

70
00:04:50,430 --> 00:04:52,430
We ran into each other and teamed up.

71
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:54,900
Thanks. You were a big help.

72
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:58,680
Thank you! I'm Rafinha Bilford.

73
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,850
Nice to meet you!

74
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,890
"Bilford"?

75
00:05:01,890 --> 00:05:05,350
Then, you're Master Rafael's younger sister?

76
00:05:06,090 --> 00:05:08,320
You know Brother Raf?

77
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:11,180
Y-Yes.

78
00:05:11,790 --> 00:05:14,550
He's been very good to me.

79
00:05:15,970 --> 00:05:17,490
You three.

80
00:05:18,170 --> 00:05:21,120
Thanks for helping protect the town.

81
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:24,250
We'd like to offer you a small reward...

82
00:05:25,050 --> 00:05:27,480
Isn't that great, Chris and Leone?

83
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:29,750
Just you two.

84
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:34,430
We've got nothing to give a clan of traitors.

85
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:36,280
Traitors?

86
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:40,400
Wait! Leone helped too!

87
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,950
It's okay, Rafinha.

88
00:05:41,950 --> 00:05:43,350
Go without me.

89
00:05:43,350 --> 00:05:45,660
No! It doesn't make sense!

90
00:05:45,660 --> 00:05:48,780
You don't seem to know, so I'll fill you in.

91
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:51,140
That woman is the sister of Leon Olfa,

92
00:05:51,140 --> 00:05:58,280
a former holy knight who 
betrayed this country and fled.

93
00:05:58,620 --> 00:06:01,680
Leon Olfa...?

94
00:06:04,950 --> 00:06:07,350
That explains where 
I'd heard the name before.

95
00:06:07,770 --> 00:06:11,290
If you're seen together, 
people will start to talk.

96
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,880
Now, we can give you that 
reward over there...

97
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,000
No, thank you!

98
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,000
I don't need any reward 
from the likes of you!

99
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:35,140
What's going on here?

100
00:06:35,140 --> 00:06:36,590
Master Rafael!

101
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:40,370
It's just the traitorous knight's sister.

102
00:06:40,370 --> 00:06:42,750
You don't need to worry about her...

103
00:06:42,830 --> 00:06:46,880
Rafael  Age 23

104
00:06:43,330 --> 00:06:46,950
Please don't talk about Leone like that.

105
00:06:47,350 --> 00:06:51,810
She helped with the magicite 
beasts again, didn't she?

106
00:06:51,810 --> 00:06:53,300
You could give her a little credâ€”

107
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:54,820
Brother Raf!

108
00:06:54,820 --> 00:06:55,720
Rani?

109
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,140
Is that you, Rani?

110
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:59,260
I never thought I'd see you here.

111
00:06:59,510 --> 00:07:02,360
It's been a long time, cousin.

112
00:07:06,650 --> 00:07:08,950
<i>He's grown into a fine young man.</i>

113
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:11,530
Y-You've become such a pretty lady.

114
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,760
I didn't recognize you.

115
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:18,730
Oh, Rafael almost never has 
anything nice to say about girls.

116
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:21,870
Girls love him, but he's incredibly dense.

117
00:07:21,870 --> 00:07:24,750
S-Stop it, Ripple...

118
00:07:27,140 --> 00:07:28,800
This is Ripple.

119
00:07:29,450 --> 00:07:33,050
One of our nation's Hyral Menases, 
alongside Eris.

120
00:07:33,050 --> 00:07:34,850
Nice to meet you!

121
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:37,370
<i>A Hyral Menas?</i>

122
00:07:37,370 --> 00:07:39,030
<i>I bet she's strong!</i>

123
00:07:39,590 --> 00:07:43,050
What are you two doing here?

124
00:07:43,050 --> 00:07:45,770
Also, you know Leone?

125
00:07:46,030 --> 00:07:47,170
Well...

126
00:07:47,910 --> 00:07:49,700
Are you hungry?

127
00:07:49,700 --> 00:07:51,810
We can talk about it over a meal!

128
00:07:51,810 --> 00:07:53,700
I'm always up for food!

129
00:07:54,260 --> 00:07:56,080
Come with us too, Leone.

130
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:58,530
I need to thank you for helping the girls.

131
00:08:00,550 --> 00:08:03,050
So all that happened in Nova?

132
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:07,290
I'd heard their magistrate went missing.

133
00:08:07,290 --> 00:08:11,770
But I can't believe you two survived a 
meeting with the Bloodchain Brigade's leader.

134
00:08:11,770 --> 00:08:15,530
What I'm most curious about 
is the Levitation Circle.

135
00:08:15,530 --> 00:08:19,720
You knew about it, and you still handed 
the city over to the Highland?

136
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:24,420
If you did, I think that's 
a problem, Brother.

137
00:08:24,690 --> 00:08:28,020
Yeah, you're right.

138
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:32,310
So it's not just Rafael. You two agree, huh?

139
00:08:33,900 --> 00:08:37,600
And that's the magistrate, 
who's now a magicite beast?

140
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:39,420
She's cute.

141
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:41,630
It's hard to believe she's a magicite beast!

142
00:08:42,650 --> 00:08:45,340
She shouldn't be in there!

143
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:47,830
Please, do something!

144
00:08:47,830 --> 00:08:49,570
S-Sorry.

145
00:08:49,570 --> 00:08:52,220
She likes girls with big breasts.

146
00:08:52,220 --> 00:08:55,290
Hooray! It's not just me anymore!

147
00:08:59,730 --> 00:09:02,960
What was with that knight, though?

148
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,770
He didn't need to be such a jerk.

149
00:09:04,770 --> 00:09:06,480
It happens all the time.

150
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:09,740
But you still fight to 
protect the townspeople?

151
00:09:10,030 --> 00:09:14,220
You can't worry about that stuff 
when the magicite beasts are attacking.

152
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:16,840
Yeah, you're right!

153
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,070
I respect that!

154
00:09:18,410 --> 00:09:19,870
Thank you.

155
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:23,860
But don't be too hard on the townspeople.

156
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:26,270
They just expect a lot out 
of holy knights, that's all.

157
00:09:27,070 --> 00:09:32,790
Everyone was so proud of my brother because 
he was the first holy knight from our town.

158
00:09:33,230 --> 00:09:36,670
And then he killed not only 
a Highlander emissary,

159
00:09:36,670 --> 00:09:40,080
but even the inspector from the capital.

160
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:44,070
Wait. Lord Shiony, the inspector, was...

161
00:09:44,070 --> 00:09:48,250
So they told the public 
that it was all Leon's doing.

162
00:09:48,250 --> 00:09:52,350
But doesn't that make him out 
to be a really bad guy?

163
00:09:52,350 --> 00:09:55,990
He was only mad because of what Rahl did!

164
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:59,580
You met my brother?

165
00:09:59,580 --> 00:10:01,130
Y-Yeah.

166
00:10:01,130 --> 00:10:03,490
He was easy to talk to and a lot of fun.

167
00:10:03,490 --> 00:10:05,450
He wasn't a bad person.

168
00:10:05,450 --> 00:10:08,150
Yeah, I agree completely.

169
00:10:08,450 --> 00:10:10,960
Thank you for saying that.

170
00:10:11,990 --> 00:10:13,990
But it's okay...

171
00:10:14,330 --> 00:10:21,500
Prince Wein and Rafael explained everything, 
and they even apologized.

172
00:10:22,260 --> 00:10:26,600
I know an apology doesn't come 
close to making things right...

173
00:10:26,850 --> 00:10:28,620
No matter how it happened,

174
00:10:28,620 --> 00:10:32,960
it's still true that my brother cast aside 
the title of holy knight and this nation.

175
00:10:33,350 --> 00:10:34,830
Leone...

176
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:41,640
So I'm going to become a full-fledged knight 
and capture him.

177
00:10:42,020 --> 00:10:46,690
If you need to become a full-fledged knight, 
does that mean...

178
00:10:46,690 --> 00:10:49,740
She's going to the knights' academy 
in the capital city.

179
00:10:49,740 --> 00:10:51,000
Really?

180
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,700
So are we!

181
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:55,520
You are?

182
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:57,420
That's great.

183
00:10:57,420 --> 00:10:59,570
If I'm with you...

184
00:10:59,570 --> 00:11:01,380
What a coincidence!

185
00:11:01,380 --> 00:11:02,770
This'll be the start of a long friendship!

186
00:11:02,770 --> 00:11:04,150
It sure will!

187
00:11:04,150 --> 00:11:05,470
Yeah!

188
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:12,470
I'm hoping they can solve the problem 
of the magicite beasts appearing in town.

189
00:11:12,470 --> 00:11:14,550
They just appear all of a sudden in town?

190
00:11:14,550 --> 00:11:16,390
That's strange.

191
00:11:16,390 --> 00:11:18,270
The place is well-guarded.

192
00:11:18,270 --> 00:11:20,190
It's been happening a lot lately.

193
00:11:20,190 --> 00:11:23,950
They just show up in the middle of 
the city without any Prism Flow...

194
00:11:23,950 --> 00:11:27,000
You don't need to worry about that, Leone.

195
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:52,600
We think the frozen Prismer is what's 
been drawing the magicite beasts.

196
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,360
So...

197
00:11:53,690 --> 00:11:59,310
So if you carry it somewhere else, 
they'll stop appearing in town.

198
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:01,780
What a sight, huh?

199
00:12:01,780 --> 00:12:04,410
I didn't know Flying Gears could do that!

200
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,900
What did you want to talk about?

201
00:12:07,570 --> 00:12:11,490
You're the crazy-powerful girl 
Eris told me about, right?

202
00:12:11,860 --> 00:12:14,340
Eris told you about me?

203
00:12:14,860 --> 00:12:18,930
We're keeping it a secret between us 
Hyral Menases for now, though.

204
00:12:18,930 --> 00:12:20,570
Thank you very much.

205
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:23,940
So, whaddya think? Can you beat it?

206
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:26,880
Nobody fights to lose.

207
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:31,720
The truth is, it was the one who 
locked itself inside that ice.

208
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:34,260
This was decades ago.

209
00:12:35,010 --> 00:12:36,970
I saw it with my own eyes.

210
00:12:37,750 --> 00:12:41,780
I heard once that Hyral Menases 
have long lifespans, but...

211
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:44,550
I'm actually quite the old lady.

212
00:12:44,550 --> 00:12:45,940
So's Eris.

213
00:12:46,340 --> 00:12:49,570
<i>Actually, though, I'm an old man...</i>

214
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:53,600
We tell everyone it's a corpse 
so they don't get scared.

215
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:58,370
What's happened lately is a sign 
that it'll soon revive.

216
00:12:58,670 --> 00:13:01,580
So you're carrying it near the border,

217
00:13:01,580 --> 00:13:04,910
and away from any cities, in case it does?

218
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:08,810
And not only that, you're using 
the magicite beasts it creates

219
00:13:08,810 --> 00:13:11,150
as a defense against invasion 
by enemy countries...

220
00:13:11,150 --> 00:13:12,660
You look upset.

221
00:13:12,660 --> 00:13:14,220
It's a waste!

222
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:17,860
The magicite beasts and invading armies 
will destroy each other!

223
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:23,160
But this is a great spot to fight a Prismer 
without worrying about the surroundings.

224
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:27,460
Yup! It's nice to see you're 
looking at this optimistically.

225
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:28,390
Of course!

226
00:13:28,390 --> 00:13:30,070
Make sure you call me when it happens!

227
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:32,780
Let's make a pinky promise, then.

228
00:13:42,100 --> 00:13:46,510
Ripple and I will stay here to supervise 
the transport, so this is goodbye.

229
00:13:46,950 --> 00:13:51,470
We're sending this Flying Gear Port 
back to the capital. You can ride it there.

230
00:14:00,090 --> 00:14:04,700
<i>Please revive soon, so we can 
fight to our hearts' content!</i>

231
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:11,990
Capital City Kyral

232
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:15,910
<i>And on the day we started at the school...</i>

233
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:30,510
We welcome you to the 
Royal Knights' Academy.

234
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:34,600
Prince Wein

235
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:34,720
Everyone here has been chosen 
to become a knight

236
00:14:34,810 --> 00:14:38,140
Principal Miliera

237
00:14:35,130 --> 00:14:39,930
in order to protect our nation 
of Caralia and its citizens.

238
00:14:40,650 --> 00:14:43,110
Study hard, and keep 
your honor and the weight

239
00:14:43,110 --> 00:14:45,420
of the responsibility you bear 
in your hearts at all times.

240
00:14:49,760 --> 00:14:54,990
Hello, everyone! 
I'm Miliera, your principal!

241
00:14:54,990 --> 00:14:57,200
Nice to meet you all!

242
00:14:56,090 --> 00:14:59,560
That's the principal?

243
00:14:59,560 --> 00:15:01,090
Look carefully.

244
00:15:02,700 --> 00:15:04,230
A Special-class Rune!

245
00:15:04,230 --> 00:15:07,050
Just like Brother Raf. Which means...

246
00:15:07,350 --> 00:15:09,960
She's strong enough to be a holy knight.

247
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:14,260
Did you hear the rumor about 
one of the new students?

248
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:16,820
The little sister of a Highlander-killer?

249
00:15:16,820 --> 00:15:18,360
Is that true?

250
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:22,930
The principal's talking, okay?

251
00:15:22,930 --> 00:15:27,610
But nobody's got time for long speeches, 
so let's begin the orientation!

252
00:15:27,610 --> 00:15:30,140
Let's start with warm-ups!

253
00:15:32,650 --> 00:15:33,370
What?

254
00:15:33,370 --> 00:15:34,130
An earthquake?!

255
00:15:38,070 --> 00:15:42,240
Everyone in the knights' class, 
I trust you've left your Artifacts behind?

256
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,150
Yes!

257
00:15:42,650 --> 00:15:44,040
I have!

258
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:45,640
Then...

259
00:15:56,810 --> 00:15:59,140
What is this?

260
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:01,860
My body's so heavy...

261
00:16:01,860 --> 00:16:05,530
This is a powerful gravity field 
generated by my Artifact.

262
00:16:05,530 --> 00:16:09,310
You'll do your combat training inside it!

263
00:16:09,310 --> 00:16:13,280
It makes me sad when my students 
die on the battlefield,

264
00:16:13,820 --> 00:16:18,780
so I'm going to train you as 
hard as I possibly can, okay?

265
00:16:19,190 --> 00:16:21,850
This is great! I love this school!

266
00:16:21,850 --> 00:16:25,280
This is rough without an Artifact.

267
00:16:25,750 --> 00:16:28,250
It's good training, though!

268
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:31,050
Okay, here we go!

269
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:37,130
Time to play a game of tag! They're "it"!

270
00:16:37,410 --> 00:16:41,570
If you can avoid being 
tagged for ten minutes,

271
00:16:41,570 --> 00:16:45,360
you get a whole month's 
free food at the cafeteria!

272
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,830
That'd be a lifesaver!

273
00:16:46,830 --> 00:16:48,700
We have to win, then!

274
00:16:48,700 --> 00:16:51,290
But I feel so heavy!

275
00:16:51,810 --> 00:16:53,730
Don't worry, Rani.

276
00:16:53,730 --> 00:16:55,830
Then without further ado...

277
00:16:55,830 --> 00:16:57,770
Ready... and go!

278
00:16:58,450 --> 00:16:59,740
Haah!

279
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,410
Take that!

280
00:17:03,410 --> 00:17:04,620
And that!

281
00:17:06,770 --> 00:17:08,430
Phew... There we go!

282
00:17:08,430 --> 00:17:09,480
Hooray!

283
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:11,720
A month of all the free food we can eat!

284
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:13,660
You're amazing, Inglis!

285
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,880
Does that mean...

286
00:17:16,190 --> 00:17:18,510
Nobody got tagged, so...

287
00:17:18,780 --> 00:17:21,680
We all get free food for a month?

288
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:27,010
What you just saw was a demonstration 
that knocking them...

289
00:17:27,010 --> 00:17:29,560
out of the ring doesn't count!

290
00:17:29,950 --> 00:17:33,400
Ma'am, I don't think that's fair.

291
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:36,120
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

292
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,990
I messed up.

293
00:17:37,990 --> 00:17:40,380
One more time, please!

294
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:47,330
That was also a demonstration, okay?

295
00:17:47,330 --> 00:17:51,790
You know, it's so important 
I had to show you twice!

296
00:17:54,090 --> 00:17:59,930
Listen. I'll give you three free months if 
you stop throwing my golems outside the ring!

297
00:17:59,930 --> 00:18:02,910
Give it to the three of us, and it's a deal.

298
00:18:02,910 --> 00:18:05,740
Very well. A bargain has been struck!

299
00:18:07,030 --> 00:18:09,180
Now, let's try this again.

300
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:11,140
Ready, go!

301
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:18,080
Ninety seconds left.

302
00:18:20,910 --> 00:18:26,840
<i>Four knights and one squire remain.</i>

303
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:30,640
I-It's coming!

304
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,750
Get away!

305
00:18:33,450 --> 00:18:35,030
Don't push me, Pram!

306
00:18:35,030 --> 00:18:37,040
I'm sorry, Rati!

307
00:18:39,250 --> 00:18:44,980
It won't be that easy to 
defeat Liselotte Arcia!

308
00:18:46,930 --> 00:18:48,900
Sixty seconds left!

309
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:50,680
You're almost there!

310
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:53,370
I'm increasing the gravitational pull!

311
00:18:55,090 --> 00:18:56,610
Wow!

312
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:58,690
This is great!

313
00:18:59,710 --> 00:19:01,690
I can't take it anymore...

314
00:19:01,690 --> 00:19:03,900
I c-can't move!

315
00:19:05,800 --> 00:19:09,330
You're so heavy! I'm going to die!

316
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,560
Don't you dare touch me!

317
00:19:16,870 --> 00:19:19,050
Last one standing!

318
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:23,840
It's over!

319
00:19:26,350 --> 00:19:27,350
She's so strong!

320
00:19:27,350 --> 00:19:28,610
Is she a squire?

321
00:19:28,610 --> 00:19:30,280
She was so amazing back there!

322
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:32,490
She's pretty, too.

323
00:19:33,140 --> 00:19:35,260
All done!

324
00:19:35,260 --> 00:19:39,390
Inglis gets the free meal tickets, then!

325
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:42,320
How fascinating!

326
00:19:42,870 --> 00:19:47,030
I'd love to ask you all kinds of questions.

327
00:19:47,350 --> 00:19:52,750
S-Sure, as long as you keep your promise.

328
00:19:55,130 --> 00:19:58,210
The food in the cafeteria was so good!

329
00:19:58,210 --> 00:20:01,690
And we get to eat as much as we want! Wow!

330
00:20:01,690 --> 00:20:04,390
The desserts were great, too!

331
00:20:04,390 --> 00:20:09,130
Leone should've stayed for dessert 
instead of heading back alone.

332
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:13,350
I told you, I can't stay in a room like this.

333
00:20:13,970 --> 00:20:17,320
I'm supposed to trust the sister of a 
holy knight who betrayed his country?

334
00:20:17,620 --> 00:20:21,270
Why was she even allowed to enroll?

335
00:20:21,270 --> 00:20:27,560
Well, the academy decided there 
was nothing wrong with her...

336
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:29,690
And I'm saying that decision was wrong!

337
00:20:29,690 --> 00:20:34,410
The least you can do is reassign her 
to a different room!

338
00:20:35,590 --> 00:20:37,990
Very well.

339
00:20:38,430 --> 00:20:41,190
Would anyone like to switch rooms?

340
00:20:41,190 --> 00:20:44,810
Okay! Come to our room, then!

341
00:20:45,350 --> 00:20:46,900
You're all so mean!

342
00:20:46,900 --> 00:20:51,350
She fought the magicite beasts 
to protect the people of Almen!

343
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:54,020
Even when they said awful things 
about her, she never complained!

344
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:56,740
A girl like that can't be a bad person!

345
00:20:56,740 --> 00:20:58,730
Rani, calm down.

346
00:20:59,090 --> 00:21:01,660
We'll have three people in our room.

347
00:21:02,670 --> 00:21:04,690
Let's go, Leone.

348
00:21:08,330 --> 00:21:10,490
I'm sorry this keeps happening.

349
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:21,790
I still think I should sleep on the floor.

350
00:21:21,790 --> 00:21:24,160
It's fine. We can sleep in the same bed.

351
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:26,120
Me too, then!

352
00:21:28,130 --> 00:21:30,050
We can all sleep in the same bed!

353
00:21:30,050 --> 00:21:32,720
Thank you both!

354
00:21:39,990 --> 00:21:41,780
She sure fell asleep fast.

355
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:43,520
It's her first day at school.

356
00:21:43,520 --> 00:21:44,990
She's tired.

357
00:21:44,990 --> 00:21:49,200
It's been so long since I slept in 
the same bed as someone else.

358
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:51,400
You're not alone.

359
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:53,710
We're with you.

360
00:21:53,710 --> 00:21:55,210
Don't worry.

361
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:03,210
Thank you, Inglis...

